      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there benefit in creating a new error type just for this result?\n\nStated differently: will an API client be expected to take action based on different error codes? Or are the error codes simply informational?\n\nIf they are informational, then I\u0027m not seeing a good reason to create specific errors here, as it\u0027s just going to generate code to deal with errors of varying types (often just mapping one error type to another).",
