        "id": 1833664
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-15T17:32:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The update looks good, thanks.\n\nI was a bit worried about a proliferation of different error types, resulting in lots of boilerplate to convert from one to another. Jumping right to the error type that clients will see seems like a nice simplification.",
      "parentUuid": "fff07895_f669526e",
      "range": {
